	"data": "Data Flow Map — Post-Migration\n\nLegend: 🎙️ Journal flow · 📝 Vault flow · 🔍 Query flow · ⚠️ Bottleneck\n\nData Flow Narratives\n\n🎙️ Audio Journal Pipeline\ncithoreal records voice memo on iPhone\nAudio file → WhisperX on star → transcript .md\njournals_enrich.py adds analysis/metadata\njournals_to_vault.py moves transcript to vault\nVault watcher auto-ingests into Custom RAG (Qdrant)\njournal-notifications.json triggers OpenClaw → Signal summary\n\n📝 Vault Edit Cycle\nCalcifer or cithoreal edits a vault…",
